    "native-host-packet": "A physical Mac records authenticated packet-path evidence for the named behavior.",
    "physical-device": "The final provisioned archive exercises the stated lifecycle on a physical iPhone or iPad.",
    "physical-device-accessibility": "A physical iPhone or iPad review exercises assistive technology and the stated accessibility behavior.",
    "physical-device-control-plane": "A physical iPhone or iPad exercises the real control-plane contract and authoritative readback.",
    "physical-device-packet": "A physical iPhone or iPad Packet Tunnel exchanges authenticated packets and records the named path evidence.",
    "protected-release": "The final bytes pass protected signing, notarization, staple, entitlement, Gatekeeper, and native verification as applicable.",
    "provenance": "The final distributed artifact and its receipts are byte-bound to reviewed source and independently verifiable without signing secrets.",
    "publication": "The final macOS artifact is bound to release metadata, published through the authenticated path, publicly re-downloaded, and retained with sanitized receipts.",
